    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i just feel bad seeing him so worn out all the time. the doctor's office is super backed up and it'll take weeks to even get a follow up. since he's a teen and already growing so much, wouldn't his body actually need even more iron to catch up? i just feel like if we're aggressive with the dose now we can just get it over with quickly. is there like a specific amount that's considered safe for a quick boost?",
